# The earlier-gate variant (log 2026-09-10): siege at 3,000 samples,
# just past the winning-close median (~3,100), after siegevh48 read the
# 4,500 gate dead even WITH the mechanism firing. The question the
# earlier gate asks: at 4,500 the enemy's compounding may already be
# unanswerable (the loss anatomy's 120k-plus endgames) -- does the same
# share, arriving while the long game is still contestable, convert
# what the late one could not? Costs a little more tempo in slow wins,
# spares the fast majority. One field off vh-siege4500.
